      "key": "basic",
      "label": "Basic",
      "parent": null,
      "rules_text": "Roll one die and add 6 for your SKILL, two dice and add 12 for your STAMINA, and one die plus 6 for your LUCK. You start with 10 Gold.\n\n**Fighting.** Each round, roll two dice and add your SKILL; then roll two dice and add your opponent's SKILL. Whoever scores higher wounds the other for 2 STAMINA. A tie means you both miss. Anyone reduced to 0 STAMINA is defeated.\n\n**Testing your Luck.** Roll two dice. If the total is equal to or less than your LUCK you are lucky. Either way, subtract 1 from your LUCK.",
